{"id":"ISS-20260723-001","title":"Plan approval continues execution before runtime exits Plan mode","status":"completed","priority":4,"severity":"high","source":"manual","description":"用户批准 plan 后，assistant 文本宣称已进入 Act mode 并派发写入 agent，但运行时实际仍处于 Plan mode。修复必须以真实 runtime mode 状态为准，保证批准、退出 Plan、继续执行的生命周期顺序一致，并补回归测试。","fix_direction":"","context":{"location":"","suggested_fix":"","notes":""},"tags":["plan","approval","lifecycle","regression"],"affected_components":[],"feedback":[],"issue_history":[{"timestamp":"2026-07-23T09:08:20.147Z","from_status":null,"to_status":"open","actor":"maestro-cli","note":"Issue created"},{"timestamp":"2026-07-23T09:31:16.695Z","from_status":"open","to_status":"completed","actor":"maestro-cli","note":"权限模式循环移除 Plan；非 Plan 权限切换确定性退出 Plan；Plan confirmation 新增显式退出并保留草稿；恢复 Act 工具、prompt 与状态同步；补充 TUI 和生命周期回归测试。"}],"created_at":"2026-07-23T09:08:20.147Z","updated_at":"2026-07-23T09:31:16.695Z","resolved_at":"2026-07-23T09:31:16.695Z","resolution":"权限模式循环移除 Plan；非 Plan 权限切换确定性退出 Plan；Plan confirmation 新增显式退出并保留草稿；恢复 Act 工具、prompt 与状态同步；补充 TUI 和生命周期回归测试。"}
